{{apichanges|10.0.5|prev=10.0.2|next=10.0.7}}

==Summary==
* Added <code>instanceId</code> to {{api|GetSavedInstanceInfo}} as the 14th return value.
* Certain items and spells no longer return information from the server. For example itemID [https://www.wowhead.com/item=17/martin-fury 17] still returns <code>true</code> for {{api|C_Item.DoesItemExistByID}} but {{api|t=e|ITEM_DATA_LOAD_RESULT}} will have <code>success:false</code> and {{api|GetItemInfo}} will never return information, resulting in [[ItemMixin#ContinueOnItemLoad|ItemMixin:ContinueOnItemLoad]] never firing the callback.

